    trivia: '“Priority consideration” concerns the order or attention an application might receive. It does not automatically mean qualification or acceptance. The committee therefore keeps evaluation separate from a guarantee.', triviaQuestion: ['Does evaluating priority consideration guarantee a place for every business?', 'No. Eligibility and acceptance remain separate questions.'],
